This directory holds the cross-built Shim binaries that `brama` embeds.

It is empty in a checkout on purpose, and this file is here so that the embed
directive has a directory to read — `go build ./...` and `go test ./...` then work
for a contributor who never touches SSH.

`make binary` fills it in:

    shim-linux-amd64
    shim-linux-arm64

Those builds are gitignored. A brama built without them still compiles; it fails
when asked to install a Shim, saying so and naming the fix.
